  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nariemet Off-Grid Expansion Proiect</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector:Agriculture. Fishing. Beneficiaries: 190 members, of which 115 are female and 75 male . The project funds will be used to provide the BMU with support for constructing a banda, installation of solar for powering the office and the cooling equipment,administrative costs, capital both for dried fish business and revolving fund. This will lead to financial sustainability and members living standards improved.</narrative>
